          "updatedAt": "2026-09-02T11:40:29.822Z"
        },
        {
          "content": "\u003cp\u003eFrom 10:00 to 13:00 Moscow time, the service will be operated by the backup provider.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt this point, it can be observed:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e– Unavailability of operations for connecting virtual machines to the service, management of backup and backup policies through the user interface, CLI and API for up to 60 minutes;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e– There may be problems in starting and executing backup tasks, as well as a drop in the speed of creating and restoring backups.\u003c/p\u003e\n",
